            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.31</h2>
<ul>
<li>Drag a card out of the Clipboard and drop it where you want it. Dragging one used to slide the notch's pages instead.</li>
<li>A copied picture drags out as a PNG file, so it drops into Finder, a chat or an upload box. A link opens in the browser you drop it on.</li>
<li>Dragging a file out of the Tray no longer nudges the pages either.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
